Initialize a repository: git init
Add individual files: git add 'file_name(s)'
Add all the files: git add .  
Message/Reason for the file: git commit -m "Message"
Add the repository link (This needs to be created on GitHub/Bit Bucket):
git remote add origin 'link to your git repo'
Push everything to the branch: git push origin 'branch'
Clone a repo: git clone 'repo link'
Status of a repo: git status
Typo Fix: git commit -am 'fixed typo'
Update your local repo with files from cloud repo: git pull
